      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood her ground, her curiosity stronger than the fox's stern command. She knew the humming was a mystery meant for her, and she wasn't about to turn back now. Mosk sighed, his ears drooping as he realized this visitor was not easily swayed by his grumpy warnings."
    }
