      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door with a trembling paw. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and whispered that this was for the trouble of walking her down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his eyes softening. Then he stood up, adjusted his patched vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
